      "description": "In MemberJunction PR #6339, independent implementation author @AN-BC directly thanked @Nakagawa-master for identifying the same-name/different-value SQL batch parameter collision, described the independently implemented token-aware correction and tests, noted substantive reviews across other MemberJunction PRs, and voluntarily asked who was behind the Nakagawa-master GitHub handle. This is a source-native technical adoption and a direct person-interest statement; the PR was still open at last check.",
